    <!-- The stream menu's compact grid on a handheld or tablet, as desktop Nightjar's: a 20dp icon over a 12sp label, up
         to four tiles to a row while each stays wide enough for its label, the ways out in capsules at the foot. A TV has its own, for the distance (values-television). -->
